WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.160
You just merged your pull request.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.540
And nothing happened.

3
00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.350
What if it felt like this?

4
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.410
Meet Footlit.

5
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.849
A free GitHub extension

6
00:00:08.849 --> 00:00:11.810
that gives every moment a standing ovation.

7
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.960
Create a repo. Opening night.

8
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.130
Break the build. The show stops.

9
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.710
Merge it. Take a bow.

10
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.700
Six hand-built themes.

11
00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.800
Free. Private. Nothing leaves your browser.

12
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.170
Footlit. Free for Chrome and Firefox.

